<view class="col" style="min-height: 100vh; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 24rpx 50rpx 60rpx 50rpx;">

  <text class="kicker">即时援助</text>
  <view class="h2 mt16">先回 TA 一句</view>
  <view class="sub mt8">一句温和、不升级的话，先把这一刻接住。发不发、怎么改，都由你。</view>

  <view class="card mt48" style="padding: 48rpx 40rpx;">
    <view class="row" style="justify-content: space-between;">
      <text class="pill pill-honey">只是建议</text>
      <text class="faint" bindtap="change">换一句</text>
    </view>
    <view class="mt24" style="font-size: 32rpx; line-height: 1.9;">{{suggestion}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="faint mt24">这句话不带指责、不下结论，也给了下一次好好谈的时间。</view>

  <view class="grow"></view>

  <block wx:if="{{!copied}}">
    <view class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="copy">复制这句 · 去微信发</view>
  </block>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="next">已复制 · 去发传票</view>
  </block>
  <view class="center mt24"><text class="faint" bindtap="next">跳过，直接发传票</text></view>

</view>
